msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Seems like we could've done a lot better. Let's put in more\r\n"
"effort next time, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Oh, okay... Will do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Good work out there tonight. I think you're getting the hang\r\n"
"of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Thank you, sir. I know I haven't been here long...\r\n"
"But I'll reach the top someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Great job out there tonight. I could tell you were giving it\r\n"
"your all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Whew... Yeah, I guess I did pretty good, huh? ...I'm glad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Let's work on your presentation. Makeup, hair, posture...\r\n"
"All of these things send certain signals to a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Hmm... Tell me more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "All right, I think that just about covers it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Huh. Guess you learn something new every day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Hmm... I honestly think you have a ways to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Sorry... I'll try to be more focused next time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Okay, so today we're going to study a little trivia. No\r\n"
"matter what the conversation, it's always important to be\r\n"
"smart about what you say. \"Knowledge is power,\" right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Oh, uh, yeah... Teach me your ways, Kiryu-sensei!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "All right, that should be more than enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "That was... actually pretty interesting. I had fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not quite sure you got the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Yeah... That was a lot to chew on... I'm not sure if my\r\n"
"brain can digest it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Right now, I'd like to give you some conversation tips to\r\n"
"help you captivate the customers. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Sure. If it'll help me get better at talking to guys, then\r\n"
"let's get started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "All right, I think you've pretty much got it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "So that's how guys think... Okay, I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Hmm... I think you could still use a little work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Aww... That's kinda depressing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"I think you should spend your downtime doing whatever you\r\n"
"like. You've definitely earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "Thanks... I could use a little mental vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"Did you make the most of your time? You seem pretty\r\n"
"energetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "Oh, for sure! Yep, I'm all back together. Let's do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Hmm... Are you sure you're doing okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "...Sometimes, I wonder about that myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to work on your weak points. Now I know I\r\n"
"might come off a little blunt, but bear with it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Ooh... If you must... Okay, here it comes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"All right, now think about what I told you and give it your\r\n"
"full effort next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Understood. Hey, that wasn't so bad at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "(I don't think any of that really got through to her...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "...Can I go now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"I think you should take some time off for yourself and relax\r\n"
"to your heart's content. Do what's good for %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "Yeah... I'd like that... Thanks, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "So, how was your time off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Oh, it was the best! Wanna hear about it? Okay, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "So, did you enjoy yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "...Huh? Did I what now? Oh... Um... Kinda sorta? Not really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to find a way to keep you motivated and\r\n"
"help you stay positive. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "Yeah, let's do that. I'm all for positive vibes here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid "Well? How's that for positive thinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "That... honestly blew my mind. You're like some kinda guru."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "Well? Do you feel more positive now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "Positive...? Wait, what were we talking about again?"
msgstr ""

